OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings disruption with
OL,4,Athe full force still to come
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Boelo has brought gusts of more
OL,7,Fthan 70mph (113kph) to the east coast
OL,8,Fof Northern Ireland, with conditions
OL,9,Fdue to worsen later.
OL,11,FSome sporting events and Halloween
OL,12,Ffireworks displays have been cancelled,
OL,13,Fflights and ferries disrupted, and the
OL,14,FFoyle bridge in Londonderry is closed
OL,15,Fin both directions.
OL,17,FAn amber warning covering parts of
OL,18,Fcounties Antrim and Derry comes into
OL,19,Fforce at 21:00 BST until 10:00 GMT on
OL,20,FSunday with gusts of about 80mph or
OL,21,Fmore forecast in exposed areas.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
